From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:39:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] AMLCapture: capture video from the vdin1 v4l2 node

Kodi has no reader for the vdin1 V4L2 node, which delivers the video
layer after the VPP, DV and HDR cores. The decoder's pictures carry no
HDR statics. Only the frame metadata store holds them. vdin reports its
limits, stride and stops, and gives no frames while the output is muted.
